      "source": "Unlike `withUnsafeMutableShapedBufferPointer(:)`, this function allows the caller to specify the buffer layout.",
      "normalizedSource": "Unlike `withUnsafeMutableShapedBufferPointer(:)`, this function allows the caller to specify the buffer layout.",
